Whenever I make much of a change in SUE, the dpc tutorial pearl files
must regenerated or else the incorrect paths are highlighted when
running the tutorial in demo mode.  Thanks to Kathy's suggestion, I
have now built a script(s) to automate this.  

There are two scripts:

      build   ---> creates the tutorial.tar file
      install ---> copies tutorial.tar into build dir

To run:

   cd /volume/mmi/src/sue/doc/dpc_build_tutorial
   ./build
   ./install
